   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m having a problem and not sure if you&#39;d be able to help me. I set up a MGCFA with models with different items for each group</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">GROUPcomparison</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;<br>group: 1<br>fac1  =~ J1 + J2 + J3 + J14<br>fac2 =~ J5 + J6 + J7 + J9 + J13<br><br><br>group: 2<br>fac1  =~ J1 + J2 + J3 + J8 + J11 + J12 + J14<br>fac2 =~ J6 + J7 + J10 + J13&#39;</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>When I run</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">summary</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">GROUPcomparisonordinal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">measure</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> standardized</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ci</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>I get good fit and that&#39;s fine. But then, when I run</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">invresults </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> measurementInvarianceCat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">GROUPcomparisonordinal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                       data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> complete</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                       </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Study&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>I get the message:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> computeTH</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">LISREL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">MLIST </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> GLIST</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">idx </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">idx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">g</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>  dims </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">product </span><span style=\"color:#066\">36</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">do</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> match the length of </span><span style=\"color:#008\">object</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">52</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Warning</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> messages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">idx </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0L</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TAU</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1L</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  number of items to replace </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> a multiple of replacement length<br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> th </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K_nu </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%*%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> pi0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  longer </span><span style=\"color:#008\">object</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> a multiple of shorter </span><span style=\"color:#008\">object</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span></div></code></div></div><div><br></div><div>Can someone help me? Am I missing something here?</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Pedro</div></div>"
    ]
